<#import "layout.ftlh" as layout>
    <@layout.page title="About">
        <img src="https://wallpapers.com/images/hd/marvel-comics-2560x1440-wallpaper-43wij9bee89d4lit.jpg"
            alt="【entity-X-Men¦canonical_name=X-Men】 Logo" class="logo-banner">
        <div class="about-container">
            <h1>About This</h1>
            <p>This is a simple web application that allows users to view, add, edit, and delete characters from the
                X-Men universe. It is built using Java, Spring Boot, and FreeMarker for templating. I chose to use X-Men
                as the theme for this application because I like the marvel univese and they are my
                favorite fictional superheroes. I chose this design to create a visually appealing and engaging
                experience
                for users to interact with and learn about these the characters.</p>
        </div>
    </@layout.page>